OL,3,AGerard Depardieu to stand trial for
OL,4,Aalleged rape of actress in 2018, court
OL,5,Arules
OL,6,
OL,7,FFrench film actor Gerard Depardieu is
OL,8,Fto stand trial for the alleged rape of
OL,9,Factress Charlotte Arnould, a Paris
OL,10,Fappeals court has confirmed.
OL,12,FArnould, who was 22 at the time, had
OL,13,Freported the alleged rape several days
OL,14,Fafter going to his house in Paris to
OL,15,Frehearse a play.
OL,17,FShe has waived her right to anonymity
OL,18,Fand her lawyer said Thursday's ruling
OL,19,Fwas a "first" and the forthcoming trial
OL,20,Fwould be historic.
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/39
