OL,3,AMore than 1,000 flights cancelled or
OL,4,Adelayed in US as weather disrupts
OL,5,AThanksgiving travel
OL,6,
OL,7,FNearly 400 flights in the US have been
OL,8,Fcancelled so far on Thursday as bad
OL,9,Fweather coincides with busy travel on
OL,10,Fthe Thanksgiving holiday.
OL,12,FAnother 1,200 flights into, out of, or
OL,13,Fwithin the US have been delayed,
OL,14,Ftracking site FlightAware said.
OL,16,FOn Wednesday, the Federal Aviation
OL,17,FAdministration (FAA) briefly grounded
OL,18,Fall flights heading for Miami
OL,19,FInternational Airport after a FedEx
OL,20,Faircraft overran a runway. No injuries
OL,21,Fwere reported, and the FAA is
OL,22,Finvestigating.
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/39
